  "D4 diagnostic: after an owned child is reaped with a signal wait status, the manager reads the kernel message buffer once with proc_kmsgbuf (256 KiB; root only in pinned XNU) and keeps at most 8 of the newest lines, each at most 240 printable-ASCII bytes, that contain the pinned resource-limit fatal-port os_log substrings. Journal event=KernelMessages and event=KernelMessage; snapshot attempt=N kernel_messages=.. and kernel_message[i]=..; never an admission or outcome input."
 ],
